      ],
      "description": "<p>A creature hit by concentrated congealed magic's pseudopod takes (1d6-2) Persistent,void Damage damage. If the creature dies while it has this persistent damage, its corpse is affected by Peaceful Rest, except the concentrated congealed magic can still dissolve its flesh.</p>",
